{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We, my sister and I, have long lived abroad, together with the longing for our homeland. Not long ago, we received an invitation to a party in Romania, in the Carpathians. My sister, without hesitation, got into the car and left. I refused to go, but after some time I received a terrifying message from my sister. Frightened, I dropped everything and quickly set out to find her. I wonder what happened?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi is a first-person horror shooter set in the Carpathian Mountains. You will face various enemies (Vampires, Strigoi...), encounter interesting puzzles, and find different items that will help you overcome obstacles and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-open world with various interesting locations such as Mountains, Dungeons, a Village, Graveyards, an Abandoned Castle, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous and terrifying enemies for whom you are merely food and an unwelcome guest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep storyline where you must unravel the mysteries of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game world filled with dangers, including not only enemies but also traps and puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3081670?t=1770390374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081670/d33b030a92470baad33a9f96e8d2d6ec8dc537ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770390374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081670/aadbc657d5b200ba89d5a63749b90e595c2021fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770390374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081670/aadbc657d5b200ba89d5a63749b90e595c2021fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770390374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We, my sister and I, have long lived abroad, together with the longing for our homeland. Not long ago, we received an invitation to a party in Romania, in the Carpathians. My sister, without hesitation, got into the car and left. I refused to go, but after some time I received a terrifying message from my sister. Frightened, I dropped everything and quickly set out to find her. I wonder what happened?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi is a first-person horror shooter set in the Carpathian Mountains. You will face various enemies (Vampires, Strigoi...), encounter interesting puzzles, and find different items that will help you overcome obstacles and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-open world with various interesting locations such as Mountains, Dungeons, a Village, Graveyards, an Abandoned Castle, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous and terrifying enemies for whom you are merely food and an unwelcome guest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep storyline where you must unravel the mysteries of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game world filled with dangers, including not only enemies but also traps and puzzles.</p></li></ul>","developers":["SP GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081670/e5395b70618d62a42b428917618b9f1eb500621a/header.jpg?t=1770390374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3081670/807327498/058b1db19f835657dc019679c8818d1d9